  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "惜しかったな、『W.I.N.G.』……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001070010,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ええ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600107/6016001070010"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001070020,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……でも、あのステージに立たせてもらったこと\r\n本当に感謝してます",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600107/6016001070020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "千雪……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001070030,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "今までで、いちばんたくさんの笑顔を見たんです",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600107/6016001070030"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001070040,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そしたら、何か、ここまでやってきたことが、\r\n間違いじゃないって思えて……",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600107/6016001070040"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001070050,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "だから、大丈夫です",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600107/6016001070050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001070060,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "一つひとつ、一人ひとり……笑顔を増やしていく",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600107/6016001070060"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001070070,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "アイドルとしてやらなきゃいけないことは\r\n何も、変わらないですから",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600107/6016001070070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、俺も同じ気持ちだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……俺、千雪のプロデューサーをやれて、\r\nほんとによかったなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001070080,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……？\r\n……もう",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600107/6016001070080"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001070090,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "それ、勝った時に言うセリフなんじゃないです？",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600107/6016001070090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　いや\r\n今本当に言いたかったセリフだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001070100,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……ふふ、プロデューサーさん……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600107/6016001070100"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001070110,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "私も、あの時プロデューサーさんに声をかけてもらって\r\nほんとによかったです……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
